    {
      "id": "item.instance-data",
      "label": "物品实例数据关联",
      "concepts": [
        "item",
        "custom_data"
      ],
      "side": "server",
      "operations": [
        "set",
        "write"
      ],
      "status": "matched",
      "steps": [
        {
          "label": "读取现有物品信息",
          "ids": [
            "modsdk:api:server:mod.server.component.itemCompServer.ItemCompServer.GetPlayerItem"
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "持久化实例内容",
          "ids": [
            "modsdk:api:server:mod.server.component.exDataCompServer.ExDataCompServer.SetExtraData@mcdocs/1-ModAPI/接口/世界/自定义数据.md"
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "回写实例关联标识",
          "ids": [
            "modsdk:api:server:mod.server.component.itemCompServer.ItemCompServer.ChangePlayerItemTipsAndExtraId"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "cautions": [
        "extraId用于关联实例，完整内容由开发者按键保存；先确认持久化成功再改标识，保留原物品信息及已有tips。",
        "不是向userData任意塞入Python对象；世界数据需用levelId创建组件。"
      ],
      "guides": [
        "mcdocs/1-ModAPI/接口/世界/自定义数据.md",
        "mcdocs/1-ModAPI/接口/玩家/背包.md"
